<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>Still upright now we stand, no scent of smoke have we;</l><l>Resolutely we stand, face set steadfastly.</l><l>Giving up all the world, run to joy set before,</l><l>Each step fills us with hope and glory more and more.</l></lg>
</div>
